name=Assignment-4.2.md Assignment 4.2 — Job Application Form[cite: 17] What to build: A job application form using different input types.[cite: 17] Required fields:

Full name, email, and phone.[cite: 17]
Date input for date of birth.[cite: 17]
URL input for portfolio URL.[cite: 17]
Radio buttons for gender or preferred shift.[cite: 17]
Checkboxes for skills.[cite: 17]
Dropdown for qualification or job role.[cite: 17]
<textarea> for cover letter.[cite: 17]
Submit button.[cite: 17] Rules:
Every field must have a label.[cite: 17]
Make appropriate fields required.[cite: 17]
Add an example of a disabled field as well.[cite: 17]
Keep the same name for related options in radio buttons.[cite: 17] Submission: Complete job application form and screenshot.[cite: 17]